  "note": "Two gates, one file. (1) WHICH FILES are governed: the released surface is discovered by rule and every discovered document must appear here either in governedFiles or in excludedFiles with a reason, so a new contract fails even when it contains no `pattern` at all. (2) WHAT EACH GOVERNED FILE ASSERTS: every JSON Schema `pattern` entry below, by file and JSON pointer. Refresh only through a reviewed contract change: python scripts/check_pattern_census.py --update-baseline (refuses to run in CI). See https://github.com/FAIR-bioHeaders/FAIR-bioHeaders-Specification/issues/270.",
